🎯 Système d'Enchères (Bidding)

Formule de scoring

```
score = bid × quality_factor × ctr_factor × audience_factor
```

Où :

· quality_factor = 0.5 + (quality_score / 10) → de 0.5 à 1.5
· ctr_factor = 1.0 + (ctr × 10) → de 1.0 à 1.5
· audience_factor = 1.2 si in audience, sinon 1.0

Paiement second-price

Le gagnant paie le prix juste au-dessus du second :

```
paid = second_score / (0.5 + winner_qs/10) / (1.0 + winner_ctr × 10)
```

Signals pris en compte

· quality_score (0-10)
· ctr (Click-Through Rate)
· match_type (EXACT × 1.3, PHRASE × 1.1, BROAD × 1.0)
· device (DESKTOP × 1.15, MOBILE × 1.0, TABLET × 0.95)
· hour (9-17 × 1.1, 0-5 × 0.7)
· weekday (weekend × 0.9)
· in_audience (× 1.2)
· past_conversions (≥10 × 1.3, ≥3 × 1.1)

